# Ruleset: Ads
#
# Expects a reject policy.
#
# Advertising: ad networks and ad SDK zones whose only purpose is serving or measuring ads, which are named ahead of being seen, and the ad hosts inside company zones, which are named only once the gateway has seen them. Analytics and crash reports belong in Telemetry.list. Hang this on a policy that can be switched off rather than a hard REJECT, so a suspected false positive is tested by flipping the policy.
#
# A host an app needs goes in source/protected.json, and the build fails if any reject list matches it.

# Global ad networks and exchanges.
